# Backend

- Skill [create-api.md](../../skills/create-api.md).
- Route **thin** → domain in `lib/`.
- Staff API: `requireStaff()` — [lib/api/staffAuth.ts](../../lib/api/staffAuth.ts).
- Cron: `CRON_SECRET` + [lib/supabase/admin.ts](../../lib/supabase/admin.ts) service role.
- Response: `{ ok: boolean, error?: string, ... }`.
- `GEMINI_API_KEY` — **server only**, 클라이언트 노출 금지.
- Agent 실행 → `agent_logs` ([lib/agents/log.ts](../../lib/agents/log.ts)).
- RAG/Agent 상세: [AGENT_ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/AGENT_ARCHITECTURE.md), [ADR-007](../../docs/adr/ADR-007-gemini-pgvector-rag.md).
